   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Significance:** The Mahad and Kalaram satyagrahas forced the national movement to confront the issue of untouchability."
  },
  {
   "book": 1,
   "row": 250,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Second RTC:** Ambedkar again demanded separate electorates for the Depressed Classes; this and other minority claims caused the communal deadlock that wrecked the conference."
  }
